# Cards

Links to other pages. A `card` has a `title`, and optionally `href` (a page of the library or a
web address) and `image` (a file of the library). `cols` is 1 to 4.

`````markdown
::::cards cols=2
:::card title="Hint" href="hint.md"
The call-out block.
:::
:::card title="Steps" href="steps.md"
A numbered procedure.
:::
::::
`````

